<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GWA half yr net profit down 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GWA half yr net profit down 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    25.91 vs 27.61</p>
<p>    Net				     16.09 vs 17.74</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     4.5  vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: GWA International Ltd is a maker of bathroom and garden products and is about 40 percent owned by the Brisbane-based Anderson family.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  168.66 vs 179.79</p>
<p>    Other income			   3.41 vs 2.03</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    7.0  vs 9.0</p>
<p>Abnormal items</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 1</p>
<p>Reg date March 17</p>
<p>    Tax					9.82 vs 9.86</p>
<p>    Interest				 6.23 vs 6.99</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   6.49 vs 5.93</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
